to_development: The build with `--to-development` and the list of the artifact infra-3231-to-development of INFRA-3231, which every run from 2026-11-19 reads. The list names the 10 split groups whose explanations two change-1 runs of the pair check read while they were held out; their 219 cases (question 64, answer 141, phrase 1, plain 13) are development data, and no other case changes part or any other field. documents_sha256 and sessions_sha256 are the same. The held-out share of the question cases goes from 41.0% to 32.2%, of the answer cases from 40.0% to 32.9%. The build without the flag still writes cases_sha256 above.
